# Requests for REST Client (VS Code). The two access tokens come from src/Buckl.Api/.env, which git
# ignores: ALICE_TOKEN and BOB_TOKEN, for two users of the Auth0 development tenant. How to get
# them: apps/api/README.md, "Running the API locally".
@api = http://localhost:5080
@alice = Bearer {{$dotenv ALICE_TOKEN}}
@bob = Bearer {{$dotenv BOB_TOKEN}}

### Liveness, anonymous
GET {{api}}/health

### Alice adds a garment
# @name added
POST {{api}}/garments
Authorization: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classification": { "category": "top", "color": "blue", "size": "M" },
  "purchaseInfo": { "price": { "amount": 49.90, "currency": "USD" }, "date": "2026-09-01" },
  "notes": "Oxford shirt"
}

### Alice's wardrobe: one garment
GET {{api}}/garments
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Bob's wardrobe: empty
GET {{api}}/garments
Authorization: {{bob}}

### Bob asks for Alice's garment: 404 garment.not_found
GET {{api}}/garments/{{added.response.body.id}}
Authorization: {{bob}}

### Alice edits only the notes
PATCH {{api}}/garments/{{added.response.body.id}}
Authorization: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Needs ironing" }

### Alice archives it
POST {{api}}/garments/{{added.response.body.id}}/archive
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Alice's archived garments
GET {{api}}/garments?status=archived
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Alice restores it
POST {{api}}/garments/{{added.response.body.id}}/restore
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Without a token: 401 request.unauthenticated
GET {{api}}/garments

### With something that is not a token: 401 request.unauthenticated
GET {{api}}/garments
Authorization: Bearer not-a-token
